h.com%252fmod%252fin-game-account-switcher\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">In-Game Account Switcher</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inmis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inmis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252finventory-management\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory Management</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-profiles-next\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory Profiles Next</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventorio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventorio</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firon-chests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Chests</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-furnaces\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Furnaces</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fplugin%252fitemswapper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ItemSwapper</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jobsaddon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JobsAddon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-leveling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Leveling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/language-reload\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Language Reload</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/levelz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LevelZ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/libz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LibZ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/merequester\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ME Requester</a></li>\n<li>